  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MMV_Moogs_Missing_Villages/MP_MMV_MoogsMissingVillages_header.webp\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=f7941f&amp;label=DISCORD&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-f7941f?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 作品\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-f7941f?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 作品\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fmissing-villages%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"檢視結構\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MMV_Moogs_Missing_Villages/MP_MMV_MoogsMissingVillages_overview.webp\" alt=\"概述\"></p><p>此模組支援 Forge、Fabric、NeoForge 和 Quilt！也可以僅安裝在伺服器端。自 1.20.4 版本後不再支援 Forge。</p><h2><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">此模組與 TERRALITH 不相容！</span></h2><h3>關於</h3><p>Moogs Missing Villages 為叢林和沼澤生態域添加了原版風格的村莊。它的設計理念是盡可能貼近我們認為 Mojang 當初若製作這些村莊時會創作出的樣貌。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fmissing-villages%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"以 3D 形式即時瀏覽每個結構\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fmmv-moogs-missing-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ApCtgr7.png\" alt=\"MinecraftStorage\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MMV_Moogs_Missing_Villages/MP_MMV_MoogsMissingVillages_features.webp\" alt=\"特色\"> <img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/1ed547f7829847cfafee9ae5919d26ea.png\" alt=\"拼貼圖\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MMV_Moogs_Missing_Villages/MP_MMV_MoogsMissingVillages_showcase.webp\" alt=\"展示\"></p><h3>影片</h3><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OCAxt3vetLo?si=50iJa5SZ3GKNNE0c&amp;start=841\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3>模組包</h3><p>在此處查看所有模組包：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252ffinder%253fincluded_mods%253d69806\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a>。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MMV_Moogs_Missing_Villages/MP_MMV_MoogsMissingVillages_discord.webp\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p><p>獲得回覆最快且最佳的方式是加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%252fr%253dcfmmv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MMV_Moogs_Missing_Villages/MP_MMV_MoogsMissingVillages_promo.webp\" alt=\"BH 贊助\"></a></p>",
